# Act One

= A voice reaches an abandoned station.

## The arrival

EXT. RELAY STATION - NIGHT #1#

A single window glows above the sleeping town. Zoë looks up. [[Keep the town quiet, not deserted.]]

INT. CONTROL ROOM - NIGHT #2#

= Mara hears someone she thought she had lost.

MARA
You're late.

@Zoë
(holding up a broken watch)
Depends who you ask.

The radio clicks. [[Let the silence last here.]] [[Check the radio model.]]

[[The signal should sound close, almost in the room.
Avoid explaining its origin yet.
]]

## The call

MARA
There hasn't been a transmission in years.

VOICE (on the radio)
Then I suppose you weren't expecting me.

